        "TileImage": "$($repository b13314ab-ea25-48b7-9e51-8ebb87788e20).Image",
        "Description": "47,\r\rThe ICA thinks you’ve been getting a little sloppy lately. But we’re giving you a chance to prove yourself.\r\rYour assignment is to eliminate two members of the Ark Society, Amos Dexter and Jason Portman, while they’re both staying at the GAMA Private Hospital in Hokkaido, Japan.\r\rAlso, please steal the hospital’s helicopter when you leave. We may need it in case you screw up this mission. But I trust you’ll complete your assignment successfully.\r\r-Diana\r\rCreator: Shrodax\r",
